Package: shinygenui
Title: Generative UI for 'shiny'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nan", "Xiao", email = "me@nanx.me", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0250-5673"))
    )
Description: Declarative, catalog-constrained generative user interfaces
    for 'shiny'. Developers define a finite catalog of typed UI
    components; end users converse with a large language model that
    composes, updates, and removes instances of those components on a
    canvas through schema-validated 'ellmer' tool calls, streamed
    progressively into the running app. The model never emits code:
    arguments are plain data validated against the catalog, so the
    guardrails hold by construction.
